+// STA (b1822; Rule Checker X239 seat-asymmetric tie-breaks): an exact tie goes to the seat-mirrored tile order (msy_before), not the scan
+// or index order, so the two seats choose alike. Runtime data flag STA_TAB[1], read first; 0 = nova_base_v717. Bit 1 FSO1:
